WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.150
When I first met Minowa Gin,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:08.150
I thought that she would be difficult to deal with.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.030
Her voice was loud...

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.780
and she was so strong-willed...

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.160
that it overwhelmed me.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:17.410
But after we became closer, I realized that she was a really good girl.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:23.500
was to be the cause of
However, that kindness was to be the cause of her death...

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:33.200
Half a month after we've completed our first
duty in protecting humanity as Heroes,

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.910
the second enemy arrived.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.920
I can't move at all!

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.390
That spinning thing!

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.720
It looks like it's weak against a top attack, but—

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.520
We can't do anything! This isn't fair!

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.610
This is bad! I have to do something!

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:13.740
Sumi!

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:21.580
O Great God of Arms, I beseech your aid against my enemy!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:26.620
No way!

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.750
Watch out!

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:40.930
Mino-san!

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.140
Minowa-san!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.940
Brute force will only get you so far!

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.030
Yes...

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:01.530
Even if you couldn't die, fighting
this way wouldn't be enough.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:08.480
Still, you did a good job completing your duty and keeping the damage to a minimum.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.770
That's thanks to Minowa-san and Nogi-san!

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:17.050
Your weakness is your lack of practice as a team.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:21.300
First, let's decide on a leader among you three.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.390
A leader... That's me!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:25.660
Nogi-san,

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.580
can I leave this up to you?

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.330
M-Me?

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:35.460
I'm not cut out for that kind of thing.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.630
Anyone's fine, as long as it isn't me.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.180
That's right...

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.060
The Nogi family is one of the most
influential families within the Taisha.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:48.140
For a situation like this, the leader would
naturally come from a family like hers.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.520
I agree that Nogi-san should be the leader.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.230
Wasshi...

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:59.010
But in reality, I'm the one who
needs to handle the team.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.090
I need to work hard!

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.640
It's decided, then.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:07.810
According to the oracle, we should have
some time before the next attack.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:11.560
In order to improve your teamwork,
we'll be holding a training camp.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.270
A training camp?

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.460
She's late!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:04:59.730
Minowa-san's late!

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.820
Sorry, sorry. I'm late!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.130
You're late!

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.510
You were so gung-ho about this,
but you're ten minutes late!

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:07.700
Explain yourself!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.180
A lot of things happened...

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.930
Well, I mean, it <i>is</i> my fault.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:14.100
Anyway, forgive me, Sumi...

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.680
I'll give you a warning due to circumstances,

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:20.190
but I think your lifestyle is a bit sloppy, Minowa-san!

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.440
As a chosen Hero, you need to be aware—

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.900
Huh? Mom, where am I?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.740
I knew it. I'm the one who has to have it all together...

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.450
for the defense of this beautiful country!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:51.490
Now that your duty has officially started,
the Taisha will back you up with all of its power.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.500
You don't have to worry about your family
or school matters; just do your best!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:56.410
Understood!

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.960
Are you ready? The rules for this exercise are simple:

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.420
Make sure that Minowa-san gets to that bus safely.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.090
Don't forget about your assigned roles!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.430
Here we go!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.070
Defend me properly, okay?

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.810
Am I not allowed to move from my position?

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:14.060
Nope!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.230
All right, start!

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.950
Off we go!

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:25.260
Can't I just jump from here?

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.110
You can't cheat like that!

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:34.640
Piece of ca—

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.220
You're out!

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:37.580
I'm sorry, Minowa-san!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.040
Don't worry about it, Wasshi!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.790
Stop being so formal, too.
Just Gin is fine.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:47.090
Call me Sonocchi as well!
Go on, try it!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.760
All right, one more time!

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:52.070
We're doing this until you reach the goal.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:59.030
The goal of this training camp is
to train you to act in unison.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:03.980
One plus one plus one of you shouldn't
be equal to three, but ten.

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:10.630
Wasshi, is that all of your luggage?
That's not very much, is it?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.910
Do you think so?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:15.090
Mino-san, you're too quick with buying souvenirs...

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.270
And what about your stuff, Sonoko?

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:20.350
I don't even know where to start here...

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:23.310
I even brought a mortar to make udon!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.050
Out! One more time!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:32.230
And thus, Shinju-sama created the wall to protect humanity from the virus.

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:34.970
I thought we were supposed to be safe from studying here!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.530
As to what happened after...

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.960
Nogi-san, do you know the answer?

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.660
Yes!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:46.900
The Vertex were born and assaulted our homeland, Shikoku...

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:47.820
Correct.

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.110
She was actually listening...
She was actually listening...

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:54.820
All right, how about this, then!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.280
Out!

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:06.540
Thank you!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:15.050
GOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOAL!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.060
We did it!
We did it!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:33.450
Every day we get balanced meals, intensive
training, and then a good night's sleep.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:36.700
Isn't this more like training camp for a
sports club rather than for Heroes?

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:42.520
Can there be, like, some event where it goes
BAM and we get a special move, Sumi?!

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:46.170
We're practicing teamwork right now,
so probably nothing like that.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.170
I think I've gained a little more muscle.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:56.890
Being strong is fine, but for us growing girls,
this training seems to have a lot of tough menus...

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:01.410
Mino-san, don't the wounds from getting
caught up in that tornado hurt?

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.780
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:03.650
How about you, Sonoko?

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.680
If I were to choose, I guess this hurts the most.

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:09.480
Ah, that happens when you grip it too tightly...

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.990
Lady Sumi of the Washio house, please allow us to view your body as well.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.180
Wh-Why?

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.850
We would like to humbly gaze upon
the biggest breasts in our class.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.490
It's like a fruit shop here!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.970
Gimme me those peaches, Pops!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.050
W-Wait—

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.220
Stop!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.750
I'm just saying the truth!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:28.580
Aren't you living a life of luxury,
being embarrassed because they're so big!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.440
I wish I could get Sancho in the bath too...

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:39.070
Minowa-san. Washio-san.
Stop making a ruckus in the bath.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.730
Wow, an adult's body is really something else.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.370
You can't really tell when she's dressed.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.500
You're right. If I had to compare,
it's like the battleship Nagato.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.090
What's that?

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.300
A pride of our fleet from the Old Era!

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:00.260
Do you want to hear more about it?!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.080
Ah... Uh... Sure...

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:11.590
Are you two thinking you'll be able to just fall asleep on the last day of the training camp?

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:16.300
I have my own pillow with me, so I'll fall asleep no problem...

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.240
What was its name again? Tacos?

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:19.800
It's Sancho!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.140
There, there...

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.240
Anyway, Sonoko-san,
what are those clothes...

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:24.870
It's a chicken!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.000
Because I love yakitori!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.370
Well, it <i>is</i> tasty...

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:29.920
Anyway, it's not good!

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:30.880
Staying up late, I mean.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.150
You live a strict life, huh, Sumi?

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:37.110
Kids who don't listen will be taken away at night!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:39.360
Taken away!?

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:43.410
Quit it with the horror stories.
Let's talk about who we like instead!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:47.660
People we like? M-Minowa-san, do you have someone?

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:51.040
If I had to say... my little brother!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.040
Family doesn't count.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.600
Since I don't have anyone, I'm the same as you.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:56.470
Nogi-san?

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:59.300
Hee, hee, hee! I do!

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:01.470
Time for a love story!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.300
Who? Someone from our class?

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.060
Yep! Wasshi and Mino-san!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.600
Knew it.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:10.140
Is this really okay?

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.060
It is!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:14.110
We have a sacred duty to fulfill,

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.670
so let's do our best tomorrow, too!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.460
The training camp doesn't end until you're home!

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.490
Okay.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.070
Lights out!

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:23.570
Eh?

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.120
What's this?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.470
A planetarium!

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:27.750
Why here?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.930
It's pretty, so I brought it with me!

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:30.960
Turn it off!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.710
Awwww...

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.010
She's late!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.480
I'm sorry, I had some small stuff to take care of...

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:47.990
Small stuff?

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:52.870
This feels kind of suspicious.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.400
Made it just in time!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.070
You didn't make it.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.010
Sorry.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:05.030
Minowa-san is often late...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.700
But she never talks about her reasons...

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:10.720
Maybe she has problems?

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:12.710
Wait, don't!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.710
Why a cat?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.960
Far too suspicious.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.890
We're almost at Minowa-san's house.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:31.730
Nogi-san...

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.240
Wait, where'd she go?

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.900
There are ants here!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.520
Hey! Hey! How are you doing?

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:37.940
Awww...

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.450
Quit loitering around!
Awww...

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.480
Awww...

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.240
Minowa Residence
Minowa Residence

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.830
So this is Minowa-san's house, then.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:46.990
Let's get a look right away.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:47.170
Are we gonna ring and run?
Let's get a look right away.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.450
Are we gonna ring and run?

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.210
We're not doing anything awful like that!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.050
Let's use this.

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.220
I brought this just in case.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:56.930
How professional!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.760
Hey, quit crying!

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.220
You're the great Gin-sama's little brother, aren't you?

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:04.220
Don't cry.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:09.260
You can only cry when you realize that you'll never get the New Year's money back Mom said she'd keep for you.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.150
Now he's crying...

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:17.270
Doesn't seem like you need milk
or your diaper changed, either.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.440
Here! Here! Here! Here! Here!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.620
Oh, you stopped!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.860
Great job, waga otouto!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.330
You're such a spoiled kid, aren't you?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:31.380
When you grow up, I'll make you my
underling and work your butt off!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.870
Oh, are you used to our house yet?

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.830
Nee-chan, the groceries!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.720
All right, give me a bit!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:43.010
Aaah, Mino-san's subarashii!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:46.010
She's babysitting and helping around the house!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.970
So she has brothers this young, huh?

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.190
Taking care of them must be a lot of trouble...

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.110
Ah! Wasshi! Look, over there!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.080
Did he ask her for directions?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.290
And again!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.080
Mino-san's so kind!

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.330
She's picking up a bicycle that fell down.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.080
It's just one thing after another...

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:20.790
Is Mino-san the type of person who
gets dragged into a bunch of things?

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.550
Maybe it's because she's a Hero?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.470
Now it's a lost child.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.720
Stopping a quarrel?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:35.470
It's not so much that she gets dragged in...
It's that she can't abandon those in trouble.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.430
I can't watch this anymore.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.520
Minowa-san!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.360
Sumi?

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.270
Sonoko's here, too!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.190
We'll help you out!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.740
Huh? Wait, you don't have to!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.570
Wait, so you two have been watching
me since I was at my house?!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.000
That's kind of embarassing, you know.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.750
There's nothing embarassing about it! It's admirable!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.380
So this is why you're always late for school?

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.340
You should've just told us!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.880
But that'd be like blaming other people...

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.640
It doesn't matter why.
I was the one late for school, after all.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.390
Has it always been like this?

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.430
Yeah, I've always been unlucky.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.480
I've never won at bingo or anything, either.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:19.610
Poor me.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.080
See? There goes my Sunday.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.330
This time for sure, I—

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.240
Here it comes!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.020
It's got some visual kei look going on.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:51.440
For now, let's see if this works!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.330
Woah, what's going on?

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.910
Is the enemy doing that?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.910
Th-This time...

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.630
This time! This time for sure!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.040
Relax, Sumi.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.050
Minowa-san...

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.800
Let's defeat it together!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.100
Nogi-san...

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.760
Time to show off the results of the training camp, don't you think?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.720
Girls...

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.610
And— there!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.110
Okay, let's get closer to the enemy!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.860
Got it!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.130
It took air supremacy!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.170
Get down here, you bastard!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.470
It's planning something!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.560
Guts!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:07.940
Mino-san!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.900
I'll hold it back for a minute!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.980
Get the enemy up there!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.700
But if we do that, Minowa-san will be in dan—

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:20.240
What should we do? The damage to the real world—

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.120
Minowa-san—

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:23.620
What should we do?

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.870
Both of us will go defeat the enemy!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.290
Wasshi, up there!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.130
Huh... R-Roger that!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:45.970
Mino-san!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.480
Let it reach!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.490
Hey you...

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:04.700
Get out of here!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.120
Charge!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.170
Mino-san!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.880
Destroy it!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.640
I'll pay you back three times as much!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:26.640
And you can keep the change!

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.500
It's starting...

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:57.880
The Flower Calming Ceremony.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.350
It's over.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.740
Ow...

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.490
Mino-san, are you all right?

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.700
I'm tired. This battle really did a number on my back.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:34.250
We were only able to attack it because you kept defending.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.760
Thanks, Mino-san.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.760
You were amazing out there, too.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:44.390
Yeah, you said you'd hold it off for a minute,
so that meant we had a minute.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:48.180
I thought that we would be able to do
something with that much time.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.030
It would be dangerous to prolong the battle, after all.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.900
Ah... Sensei saw through that.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:00.150
Nogi-san's insight in an emergency...

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.360
I could only hesitate back there.

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:11.370
Yet I had the gall to think she was
chosen because of her lineage.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.080
I'm such an idiot.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.000
I thought I'd have to be the one
to hold it all together, but...

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.180
I only dragged those two down.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.430
I'm hungry!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:30.220
We were in the middle of
eating udon, weren't we?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.980
Sumi, what's wrong?
Are you hurt somewhere?

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.310
No, I'm...

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:42.370
I'm sorry!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.860
I'll support you guys properly the next time...

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:47.660
I'll do my best!

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.920
Yeah! We'll all have to!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.790
Here you go, Wasshi!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.040
Thanks...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.130
Sonocchi...

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.250
Say it again, Wasshi!

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:05.840
S-Sonocchi...

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.090
And me? What about me?

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:10.430
Gin...

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:12.510
Gin!

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:16.100
I'm glad...

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:19.650
Kind of feels like we're finally buddies now.

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:21.570
Gin...

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:25.280
This is the story of three Heroes.

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:29.110
A fairy tale of girls chosen by the gods.

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:35.000
In any age, it's always pure girls
who catch the eyes of the gods.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:40.250
And often, the result of that is...
